WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:02.167
-Welcome back, everybody.

00:00:02.167 --> 00:00:03.534
It is time to settle some of the biggest

00:00:03.534 --> 00:00:06.200
and most important food debates of all time.

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.701
But I'm gonna need some help.

00:00:07.701 --> 00:00:09.667
His new show, "Next Level Chef,"

00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:12.167
airs Wednesday at 9:00 p.m. on Fox.

00:00:12.167 --> 00:00:15.033
Please welcome Gordon Ramsay, everybody!

00:00:15.033 --> 00:00:16.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:16.467 --> 00:00:20.434
That's my man right there! Ah ha ha!

00:00:20.434 --> 00:00:22.100
-Ahh. -Gordon Ramsay!

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.767
-Hello, mate. How are you? -I'm doing good, my friend.

00:00:24.767 --> 00:00:26.334
Gordon, are you ready to do this?

00:00:26.334 --> 00:00:28.767
-I am. I've got to give a quick hello from somebody.

00:00:28.767 --> 00:00:30.534
I just want to -- Before he goes to bed.

00:00:30.534 --> 00:00:32.200
Oscar bear, say, "Good night, Jimmy."

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:34.000
-Yay! Buddy, hi!

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.100
-Say, "Good night, Jimmy." Say, "Good night, Jimmy."

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:37.701
-Good night, good night.

00:00:37.701 --> 00:00:39.367
-Say, "Good night." [ Laughs ]

00:00:39.367 --> 00:00:40.667
Thank you. -He's so cute.

00:00:40.667 --> 00:00:42.367
-No, he's not saying, "Good night."

00:00:42.367 --> 00:00:43.868
He wasn't happy with his dinner.

00:00:43.868 --> 00:00:46.367
-[ Laughs ] He wasn't -- Yeah. Of course not. Yeah.

00:00:46.367 --> 00:00:48.901
Look at his dad. Of course, yeah.

00:00:48.901 --> 00:00:51.133
You shouldn't serve him, like, eight courses, yeah.

00:00:51.133 --> 00:00:53.200
-Bad. -Guys, it is time for

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:54.367
"Gordon Ramsay Settles It."

00:00:54.367 --> 00:00:55.868
Here we go.

00:00:55.868 --> 00:00:57.667
-♪ Gordon Ramsay Settles It ♪

00:00:57.667 --> 00:01:00.901
♪ Gordon Ramsay Settles It ♪

00:01:00.901 --> 00:01:03.200
-Alright, buddy. First one.

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:07.000
Does fruit -- Does fruit count as a real dessert?

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.501
-Of course it [bleep] doesn't.

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:10.334
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.334 --> 00:01:11.634
-You can't -- -Come on, man.

00:01:11.634 --> 00:01:14.033
-You can't say that. You can't say that.

00:01:14.033 --> 00:01:16.133
-[Bleep]. Sorry. No, it doesn't.

00:01:16.133 --> 00:01:18.100
-Of course it doesn't. Yeah. Thank you.

00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:20.100
-Thank you. -Two, should you cut the crust

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:22.400
off a peanut-butter and jelly sandwich?

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:25.934
-No! Stop being a snob. The crust are good.

00:01:25.934 --> 00:01:28.133
[ Applause ]

00:01:28.133 --> 00:01:30.000
-Yeah, but on a white bread -- on white bread

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:31.200
with peanut-butter and jelly,

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:32.400
I don't think you need the crust.

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:35.767
-No. Man, you've changed. -Oh, my g--

00:01:35.767 --> 00:01:37.400
Ha. Alright.

00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:41.501
Number three, Sriracha or Frank's Red Hot?

00:01:41.501 --> 00:01:43.834
-Definitely Sriracha. -Wow.

00:01:43.834 --> 00:01:46.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:46.067 --> 00:01:48.434
I feel like it's like a roller coaster for me.

00:01:48.434 --> 00:01:50.801
Sometimes I love it, and then I'm, like, tired of it.

00:01:50.801 --> 00:01:52.367
Alright. Here we go.

00:01:52.367 --> 00:01:55.000
Ketchup with eggs: janky or swanky?

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:58.133
-Definitely swanky...

00:01:58.133 --> 00:02:01.267
-I totally agree with you! It is totally swanky!

00:02:01.267 --> 00:02:03.200
[ Laughs ]

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:06.601
Leftover pizza -- eat it cold or reheat it?

00:02:06.601 --> 00:02:08.734
-Get it in the [bleep] trash.

00:02:08.734 --> 00:02:10.000
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:11.667
-Come on, dude. Don't do that to me, man.

00:02:11.667 --> 00:02:15.167
-Come on. -Don't do that to me, man.

00:02:15.167 --> 00:02:18.267
Red-wine teeth or white-wine breath?

00:02:18.267 --> 00:02:21.400
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.400 --> 00:02:23.667
-There is nothing worse than smelly breath.

00:02:23.667 --> 00:02:25.000
-I totally agree with you.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:27.334
-So I'm gonna go for red-wine teeth.

00:02:27.334 --> 00:02:29.334
-Yes. I agree with you. Yes. Thank you.

00:02:29.334 --> 00:02:30.701
-Yes.

00:02:30.701 --> 00:02:32.467
-Nothing worse than white-wine breath.

00:02:32.467 --> 00:02:35.133
That is just rancid and weird. Oh, this is interesting.

00:02:35.133 --> 00:02:38.801
Would you rather eat a brown banana or a brown avocado?

00:02:38.801 --> 00:02:40.701
-A brown [bleep] banana. Seriously?

00:02:40.701 --> 00:02:42.300
-Banana, yeah. Absolutely. Yeah, exactly, yeah.

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:44.501
Ew. Yeah. A brown avocado -- -I'll go for the avocado.

00:02:44.501 --> 00:02:45.934
-Alright, yeah, I'm sorry. Good.

00:02:45.934 --> 00:02:47.534
What's worse to get on Halloween:

00:02:47.534 --> 00:02:49.300
Necco wafers or raisins?

00:02:49.300 --> 00:02:50.901
-Give them back to them.

00:02:50.901 --> 00:02:52.234
[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.234 --> 00:02:54.400
-Give the candy back to the people.

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:56.501
-Yes. Raisins?

00:02:56.501 --> 00:02:58.234
-That's so -- That's such a Gordon Ramsay thing to do.

00:02:58.234 --> 00:02:59.734
It's like, "Yeah, I know that Ramsay kid.

00:02:59.734 --> 00:03:01.534
He gave the candy back to us."

00:03:01.534 --> 00:03:03.033
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.033 --> 00:03:06.434
Truffle oil: secret weapon or dish destroyer?

00:03:06.434 --> 00:03:08.734
-A dish destroyer! -I totally --

00:03:08.734 --> 00:03:09.968
-Should be [bleep] banned.

00:03:09.968 --> 00:03:13.400
-A restaurant destroyer.

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:15.834
Potato chips on a sandwich?

00:03:15.834 --> 00:03:17.901
-Absolutely. -Yeah!

00:03:17.901 --> 00:03:20.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:20.467 --> 00:03:21.868
Alright. Last one.

00:03:21.868 --> 00:03:23.601
Gordon Ramsay, should ranch dressing be used

00:03:23.601 --> 00:03:25.467
