00:03:25.467 --> 00:03:26.734
[ Audience saying "yes" ]

00:03:26.734 --> 00:03:28.200
-Absolutely not.

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:31.100
-Thank you! Yes! That's why we're buddies!

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:33.367
That's what I'm talking about! You heard it here first!

00:03:33.367 --> 00:03:34.968
My thanks to Gordon Ramsay!

